<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Translation on 逃避虽然可耻但有用</title><link>https://www.leelib.com/tags/translation.html</link><description>Recent content in Translation on 逃避虽然可耻但有用</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://www.leelib.com/tags/translation/atom.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>给 Mac 输入法加上边打字边翻译：灵译输入法 RimeLingo</title><link>https://www.leelib.com/2026/11/23/introduce-rime-lingo.html</link><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://www.leelib.com/2026/11/23/introduce-rime-lingo.html</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="起因"&gt;起因&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;我写东西习惯先用中文把意思打出来，要发英文或日文的时候再翻译一遍。流程是打完、复制、切到翻译工具、贴回来，要么就是从输入法的 AI 菜单里点翻译。每次都不长，但每次都断一下。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>